low-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 8px; visibility: visible;\">\n  烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n  <br style=\"visibility: visible;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%; font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 8px; font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n  风味：番石榴，樱桃，李子，可可碎\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%; font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 8px; font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n  Guava, Cherry, Red plum, Cacao nibs\n </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; visibility: visible;\">\n<br style=\"visibility: visible;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SANvK175VaJ7FbBNJWgLoPYO88lv51QsY85NFr32LBdJowho3ibzm7dyRuy4vZIkdchsX7hd07Cjw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=0\" style=\"height: auto !important; width: 578px !important; visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; visibility: visible;\">\n<br style=\"visibility: visible;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; text-align: left; line-height: 1.75em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n<strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%; font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 8px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\">\n    关于 Las Guacanas与Pacamara品种\n   </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TAWWsbN3mr1FLZttGiavtib4yTF4pjQYW9PP6RnwcvH1mibJmJicBoSGVdyDibqR46cJ9NjN0Rq3Cflmg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=1\" style=\"height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important; width: 680px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(214, 214, 214);font-size: 14px;\">\n  Huila位于上图紫红色区域\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;\">\n   Las Guacanas位于惠拉的圣安道夫镇，一直以来瓜卡纳斯都只做水洗处理的加工方式，一直到最近两年，庄园主结识到出口商Cofinet后才有机会接触了解到多种日晒处理的加工方式，于是他就开始在庄园做一些尝试；我们的这个批次是帕卡玛拉品种的二氧化碳浸渍的厌氧日晒处理，它有着像红色樱桃，李子的酸质，以及番石榴的香气特征，尾韵有着黑巧可可碎，甚至有一些朗姆的感觉，是一款酸质非常扎实，很适合夏天做冰饮或者有酸度要求的特饮。\n  </span>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RBm9fcqewxmO5rTtEpFfac5Hrogkibm23VticySj877Je6Fo46zjMhaG7mOy5MkPTf4I8409cJ1ohQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=2\" style=\"height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important; width: 680px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n   Pacamara\n  </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  帕卡玛拉最早是由萨尔瓦多的咖啡研究中心ISIC将Pacas和Maragogipe人工杂交选育而来，在萨尔瓦多，危地马拉的中美洲产国开始推行，颗粒很大，风味丰富多变\n </span>\n 。\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 8px;white-space: normal;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RBm9fcqewxmO5rTtEpFfactjKSMhVpwqgL7PCTWQribyAbH7TiaBXgwicBuLtX3D0siaKUib41kg8flAw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=3\" style=\"white-space: normal; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important; width: 400px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n   Maragogipe\n  </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  , 是铁皮卡种自然变异出来的一个超大颗粒豆型的品种，最早于1870年在巴西的Maragogipe城市发现，从而得名。\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n   Pacas\n  </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  , 是波旁种一个自然变异种（同类型的自然变异波旁种还有巴西的Caturra，哥斯达黎加的Villa Sarchi），树型较矮，最早于1949年在萨尔瓦多的圣安娜省的一个叫Pacas的农户咖啡田里发现，从而得名，现在占萨尔瓦多近25%咖啡种植，后来也推行到洪都拉斯。\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  众号的文章板块有豆子信息\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  淘宝店铺和有赞小程序可选购更多豆子～\n </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=4\" style=\"height: auto !important; width: 388px !important; visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>",
